---
// src/components/PhilosophySection.astro
---

<section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white dark:bg-[#071322] border-b border-stone-200 dark:border-slate-800 transition-colors duration-200">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center space-y-4">
      <span class="inline-block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sap-terracotta bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-500/10 dark:text-amber-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-400/30">
        Foundational Philosophy
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-sap-navy dark:text-white sm:text-4xl">
        Stewardship Above Power
      </h2>
      <p class="font-serif italic text-lg text-slate-700 dark:text-amber-200/90 leading-relaxed">
        "Politics is not the pursuit of power — it is the stewardship of society. True politics begins within and expresses itself through just and conscious governance."
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- The Dual Pillars: Awakened & Politics -->
    <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
      <!-- Awakened Card -->
      <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-slate-700/80 bg-sap-sand dark:bg-[#0e223b] p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-sap-terracotta text-white font-serif text-xl font-bold">
            A
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-sap-navy dark:text-white">What is "Awakened"?</h3>
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-sap-terracotta dark:text-amber-300 font-semibold">Self-Awareness & Discernment</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
          Being deeply aware — aware of oneself, aware of society, and aware of long-term consequences. It means having the moral clarity and wisdom to discern what is right, just, and responsible rather than reacting out of convenience or ego.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-sap-terracotta dark:text-amber-400 font-bold">✓</span> Emotional intelligence & internal mastery
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-sap-terracotta dark:text-amber-400 font-bold">✓</span> Freedom from dogmatic polarization
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-sap-terracotta dark:text-amber-400 font-bold">✓</span> Long-term generational responsibility
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Politics Card -->
      <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-slate-700/80 bg-sap-sand dark:bg-[#0e223b] p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-sap-navy dark:bg-amber-500/20 text-white dark:text-amber-300 font-serif text-xl font-bold border border-transparent dark:border-amber-400/40">
            P
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-sap-navy dark:text-white">What is "Politics"?</h3>
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-sap-navyLight dark:text-amber-300 font-semibold">Collective Stewardship</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
          The art and science of shaping the shared world we live in. At its highest expression, politics is not an adversarial arena for domination, but the sacred practice of collective responsibility and institutional care for all citizens.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-sap-navy dark:text-cyan-400 font-bold">✓</span> Stewardship of public institutions & common welfare
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-sap-navy dark:text-cyan-400 font-bold">✓</span> Empathy as the non-negotiable bedrock of policy
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-sap-navy dark:text-cyan-400 font-bold">✓</span> Constructive, bridge-building civic discourse
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- The Academic / Research Insight Banner (Matches User Screenshot) -->
    <div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#0b192c] p-8 sm:p-10 text-white shadow-xl border border-slate-700/80">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-4">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-300">
            <span>📚</span> Leadership Preformation Theory
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white leading-tight">
            "Reforming policy is not enough. We must reform leadership before it assumes power."
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">
            As documented in contemporary leadership studies (<em class="text-amber-200">Gardner et al., 2011, Journal of Management</em>), inauthentic and extractive leadership is the primary driver of institutional collapse, cynicism, and acute political polarization. SAP was founded to cultivate authentic leaders whose public actions mirror their inner integrity.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col gap-3 justify-center border-t lg:border-t-0 lg:border-l border-white/20 pt-6 lg:pt-0 lg:pl-8">
          <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-300 font-semibold">Our Non-Partisan Stance</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            SAP does not endorse any political party, candidate, or partisan agenda. We welcome learners across the ideological spectrum who commit to constitutional values, truth, and human dignity.
          </p>
          <a href="/about" class="mt-2 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-300 hover:text-white underline">
            Read Our Full Charter & Stance →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
